 integrations/flight-dynamics/gmat.ipynb       | 31 +++++++++++--------
 integrations/flight-dynamics/gmat.md          |  7 ++++-
 integrations/flight-dynamics/gmat_reader.py   | 25 ++++++++++++---
 4 files changed, 57 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

